@host = http://localhost:5268

### List orders for Acme
GET {{host}}/orders
X-Tenant-Id: acme
Accept: application/json

### List orders for Globex
GET {{host}}/orders
X-Tenant-Id: globex
Accept: application/json

### Show current tenant
GET {{host}}/me
X-Tenant-Id: acme
Accept: application/json

### The current tenant, from a call the sample makes to itself with the tenant it propagates
GET {{host}}/me/via-http
X-Tenant-Id: acme

### Acme's order count, cached for Acme (output caching per tenant)
GET {{host}}/orders/count
X-Tenant-Id: acme

### Health check (no tenant needed)
GET {{host}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Orders without tenant header (should fail)
GET {{host}}/orders
Accept: application/json

### The current tenant's database
GET {{host}}/database
X-Tenant-Id: acme

### Tenant from the subdomain (acme.localhost resolves to localhost)
GET http://acme.localhost:5268/me
Accept: application/json

### Tenant from a cookie
GET {{host}}/me
Cookie: tenant=globex
Accept: application/json

### Unknown tenant (problem details, 403: the sample hides which tenants exist)
GET {{host}}/orders
X-Tenant-Id: initech
Accept: application/json
